OL,3,GNEWSADoorman saves choking man with
OL,4,Afirst aid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doorman has described the moment he
OL,7,Fsaved a choking man's life after a
OL,8,Fpiece of kebab became lodged in his
OL,9,Fthroat outside a bar.
OL,11,FCarl Bishop, 54, from Tamworth,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, was working as a door
OL,13,Fsupervisor at Le Reve in Lichfield when
OL,14,Fhe heard people shouting that a man
OL,15,Fcould not breathe, shortly after
OL,16,Fmidnight on 20 September.
OL,18,FUsing first-aid training, Bishop
OL,19,Fcarried out abdominal thrusts and back
OL,20,Fslaps while an onlooker called an
OL,21,Fambulance.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
