OL,3,GNEWSADoorman saves choking man with
OL,4,Afirst aid
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Nothing was working," he said. "Then,
OL,7,Fafter about three minutes, a piece of
OL,8,Fmeat came flying out of his mouth."
